nav!","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"Giľaven le RAJESKE, bo kerďa igen slavna skutki,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"mi dodžanel pes pal oda calo svetos.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Vičin radišagostar a giľav zorales, tu, so bešes andro Sion!","poem":1},{"text":"Bo o Sveto Del le Izraeloskro hino baro maškar tute!“","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/rmc_the/ISA/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/rmc_the/ISA/13.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/rmc_the/ISA/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}